# Nobody else's files are redistributed through this repository. The plugin, the meshes and the
# textures are all generated at build time from mods that must already be installed - so a
# checkout plus those mods reproduces the package, and a checkout on its own carries nothing that
# is not ours. See NOTICE.md for whose is whose.
dist/Meshes/
dist/Textures/
dist/Scripts/*.pex
dist/*.esp
